    "title": "A language model scores\u2014and generates\u2014one token at a time",
    "description": "A language model assigns probabilities to whole token sequences and generates by sampling a next token from the distribution conditioned on the current context. The example contrasts an ordered sentence with a shuffled one and shows a next-token distribution."
